<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Flight Path — POAP Airport Rally has ended</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Comfortaa:wght@400;600;700&family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://tinylytics.app/embed/wzwsuAffTZQwyzBouNms.js?events" defer></script>
  <style>
    :root { --gold: #FFE44D; --purple: #8076FA; --ink: #2D2D2D; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Rubik", system-ui, sans-serif; color: var(--ink);
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #7ED8F0 0%, #FFE9A8 42%, #FBBF9E 72%, #F87588 100%);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem;
    }
    .notice {
      max-width: 40rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.86); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      border-radius: 20px; padding: 2.75rem 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(45,45,45,0.18);
    }
    h1 { font-family: "Comfortaa", cursive; margin: 0; font-size: 2.4rem; }
    .subtitle { color: var(--purple); font-weight: 600; margin: 0.15rem 0 1.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    h2 { font-family: "Comfortaa", cursive; font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    p { line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    a { color: var(--purple); font-weight: 500; }
    .archive { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.25rem; padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    .sig { color: #6b6b6b; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="notice">
    <h1>Flight Path</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">POAP Airport Rally 2026</p>

    <h2>This rally has landed for good.</h2>
    <p>On July 31, 2026, the creators of <a href="https://poap.xyz">POAP</a> (the Proof of Attendance Protocol) wound down the platform. Flight Path visualized the POAP Airport Rally — the teams, travelers, and airports, and every flight path between them — using live POAP claim data. With POAP gone, the rally has ended and this site is now retired.</p>
    <p>Thank you to every traveler who collected an airport POAP and helped fill the globe. It was a genuine delight to watch it come together.</p>

    <h2>Looking for POAP history?</h2>
    <p>Historical POAP data — drops, artwork, and addresses — is being preserved by the POAP team.</p>
    <p><a class="archive" href="https://poaparchive.com">Visit poaparchive.com &#8599;</a></p>

    <p class="sig">With gratitude to Isabel, Patricio, and the whole POAP team. — Jamie</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
